*
!application/
!application/**
# The image builds these three from composer.lock. A local copy of any of
# them would enter the build context and collide with the one composer writes.
application/vendor
!examples/
!examples/**
examples/*/vendor
examples/*/web
examples/*/recipes
!build/
!build/**
!runtime/
!runtime/**
!launcher/
!launcher/**
!Dockerfile
